Z||000006||Songman||10-03-2000||10:26 PM||||Are you supposed to use oil in your manual transmission? The fluid in mine is red like regular automatic trans fluid. That caught me off guard enough because I am used to manuals that are sealed and don't have 'checkable' fluid.||||reg||1
